{"title": "论心理", "index": 158, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\" id=\"1JFUC0-bed68e5a3b8c43b384bc54269a89d00c\">\n<h2 class=\"calibre19\" id=\"calibre_pb_22\"><a class=\"calibre10\" id=\"sec023\"></a>二三</h2>\n<p class=\"calibre4\">如果你的才能平庸，那么谦逊即诚实；但是，你若有大才，谦逊即虚伪。</p>\n</body>"}]}